    "Reuse qualified T3 current geometry/rates, preserving raw*(h/area) and pre-strain/pre-DT observables",
    "Reuse unchanged ShellElasticLaw1 PM and SIGEPS01G centered point update only; T3 owns EPSD, thickness, old-total work, DM, stiffness and projection",
